        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. The guarantees in paragraphs 1, 2, and 3 in no way limits the Company's right to terminate a Local #80 member for disciplinary reasons, for poor performance, or for any other reason provided for under the Collective Bargaining Agreement, or as provided in any other agreements between the Company and Local #80.",
