            "block_content": "7. The Company and Local #80 mutually agree that neither party will make disparaging remarks about the other in the event Local #80 seeks to organize employees of any MichCon subsidiary or affiliate not presently represented by a union in collective any organizing drives. This paragraph become effective December 7, 1997, and will expire by its terms on December 3, 2002, at Midnight.",
